# Build context is dm32uv-re/ itself (see docker/docker-compose.yml's build.context: ".."), so
# this lives at the repo root next to .gitignore, not under docker/. Mirrors .gitignore's
# machine-specific tools/ state: COPY doesn't respect .gitignore, so without this the image would
# bake in the HOST's Ghidra project (tools/ghidra_project/), tied to the host user's identity in
# Ghidra's own project-ownership tracking, and crash every container run with
# ghidra.util.NotOwnerException ("Project is owned by <host user>") since the container is a
# different "owner". The image builds its own copies of all three at build time instead
# (Dockerfile's setup.sh step) - see docker-compose.yml's comment for why those three specifically
# are never bind-mounted from the host either.
tools/.venv/
tools/ghidra_project/
tools/.env.ghidra
**/__pycache__/
.git
# Live radio captures are per-unit data and must never be baked into an image (see
# docs/live-ram-capture.md); the directory is gitignored for the same reason.
data/firmware/live-captures/
